<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 264 FOR NINE AGAINST ZIMBABWE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 264 FOR NINE AGAINST ZIMBABWE.</headline>
<dateline>PESHAWAR, Pakistan 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan were 264 for</p>
<p>nine in 40 overs in the last of the three one-day internationals</p>
<p>against Zimbabwe on Sunday.</p>
<p>The match was restricted to 40 overs a side because of crowd</p>
<p>disruption.</p>
</text>
